--TEST--
"block" tag under a "for" tag is still rejected (GRAV FORK only makes "if" transparent)
--TEMPLATE--
{% extends "layout.twig" %}

{% for i in 1..2 %}
    {% block content %}FOO{% endblock %}
{% endfor %}
--TEMPLATE(layout.twig)--
{% block content %}{% endblock %}
--DATA--
return []
--EXCEPTION--
Twig\Error\SyntaxError: A "block" tag cannot be under a "for" tag (line 4) in "index.twig" at line 5.
